Subject: [PATCH 01/56] fix-sec-3: S-2 residual: one pause guard for every
 crawl (fetchLive, snapshot.js one(), probe full mode)

server/pipeline.js#pauseError refuses a paused company (or a paused built-in's source and board)
with code 'paused' before any request; fetchLive and scripts/snapshot.js one() call it, and the
probe's full mode too. The probe's Google careers hosts now include www.google.com, the adapter's
origin, so raw mode refuses it when Google is paused. The three 2026-10-11 S-2 tests now pause the
registry entries for their run (nothing is paused today) and the round-3 residual test is un-todo'd.

